import DerivedAlgGeo.CategoryTheory.Triangulated.DGEnhancement.Basic
import DerivedAlgGeo.CategoryTheory.Triangulated.DGEnhancement.H0
import DerivedAlgGeo.CategoryTheory.Triangulated.DGEnhancement.GrothendieckGroup

/-!
# Dg enhancements of triangulated categories

The triangulated structure and Grothendieck group of `H⁰` of a
pretriangulated dg category, and the interface identifying that category with
a triangulated target. This is a structure on an abstract triangulated
category. The realization for Mathlib's homotopy category lives with that
object, in `Algebra/Homology/HomotopyCategory/DGEnhancement/`.
-/
